<title>UK: George Fisher sets 132mln SFR 6yr convertible bond.</title>
<headline>George Fisher sets 132mln SFR 6yr convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following convertible bond was announced by lead manager CSFB and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GEORGE FISHER</p>
<p> AMT 132,998,100 SFR  COUPON 2.0 PCT	 MATURITY    25.APR.03</p>
<p> TYPE CONVERTIBLE     ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    25.APR.97</p>
<p> CONVERSION PRICE    *1,950 SFR		DENOMS	5,700</p>
<p>NOTES  EXERCISABLE INTO THREE BEARER SHARES OF GEORGE FISHER</p>
<p>	  PLUS A PAYMENT OF 150 SWISS FRANCS</p>
<p>	 *A PREMIUM OF 14.71 PERCENT OVER THE CLOSING SHARE PRICE</p>
<p>	  OF 1,700 SWISS FRANCS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
